}

STRING 2139
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T490-LANDEN.ogg
{
Yes I do. I'm not letting you face Rivendare alone.
}

STRING 2153
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T520-GAREK.ogg
{
Captain! Get me out of these webs!
}

